# udim_tiling_uv: object Floor, 2x2 quad grid plane (4 quads), UVs 0..4 across (each quad spans 2x2 UV units, crossing integer borders) meant to REPEAT a tiling texture; every quad straddles tile borders (8 straddling triangles), so Auto UDIM detection must decide Off. The plane stands upright (OBJ xy plane, facing +z = the default camera), a flat floor would be seen edge-on by the default camera
o Floor
